---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Distributed Edge Intelligence & Multi-Sensor Fusion" activeNav="intelligence">
  <div class="container-wide" style="padding-top: 28px;">

    <div style="display: flex; gap: 8px; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 12px; font-size: 0.8rem;">
      <a href="/" style="color: var(--text-muted); text-decoration: none;">Platform</a>
      <span style="color: var(--border-medium);">/</span>
      <span style="color: var(--brand-primary); font-weight: 700;">Edge Intelligence</span>
    </div>

    <section style="margin-bottom: 32px;">
      <div style="display: flex; gap: 10px; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;">
        <span class="top-tag"><span class="pulse-dot"></span> PILLAR 03: DISTRIBUTED PHYSICAL AI</span>
        <span class="card-badge badge-brand">14.2ms LIBTORCH INFERENCE</span>
        <span class="card-badge badge-safe">BAYESIAN KALMAN FUSION</span>
      </div>
      
      <h1 style="font-size: 2.4rem; font-weight: 900; line-height: 1.2; margin-bottom: 14px; max-width: 960px; color: var(--text-primary);">
        Distributed Edge Intelligence: Physics-Informed Neural Networks (PINN) on Raspberry Pi 5
      </h1>
      
      <p style="font-size: 1.05rem; color: var(--text-secondary); max-width: 860px; line-height: 1.6;">
        Unlike black-box deep learning models that hallucinate false positives or require gigabytes of GPU cloud infrastructure, WATCH-DOGS embeds rigorous physical conservation laws directly into its neural loss function. Executed locally on ARM Cortex-A76 silicon at 2.4GHz with zero internet latency.
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- Edge AI Architecture Cards -->
    <div class="bento-grid" style="margin-bottom: 36px;">
      
      <div class="bento-card col-6" style="border-left: 4px solid var(--brand-primary);">
        <div class="card-header">
          <div class="card-title" style="font-size: 1.2rem; font-weight: 800;">Physics-Informed Loss Formulation</div>
          <span class="card-badge badge-brand">PINN LOSS</span>
        </div>
        <p style="font-size: 0.86rem; color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 14px;">
          The neural network is constrained to obey the 1D Richards unsaturated seepage equation and 2D Saint-Venant shallow water equations:
        </p>
        <div style="background: #f8fafc; border: 1.5px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius: var(--radius-sm); padding: 12px; font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 0.80rem; color: var(--brand-dark); margin-bottom: 12px;">
          L_PINN = L_data + &lambda;_1 L_Richards + &lambda;_2 L_MohrCoulomb
        </div>
        <p style="font-size: 0.82rem; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.5;">
          This guarantees that even when sensor packets are lost or noisy, predictions remain bounded by physical geotechnical realities.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bento-card col-6" style="border-left: 4px solid var(--status-safe);">
        <div class="card-header">
          <div class="card-title" style="font-size: 1.2rem; font-weight: 800;">Bayesian Multi-Sensor Fusion Engine</div>
          <span class="card-badge badge-safe">EXTENDED KALMAN (EKF)</span>
        </div>
        <p style="font-size: 0.86rem; color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 14px;">
          Fuses asynchronous telemetry streams from pore pressure, soil moisture, acoustic ring-down, and seismic tilt:
        </p>
        <div style="background: #f8fafc; border: 1.5px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius: var(--radius-sm); padding: 12px; font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 0.80rem; color: var(--brand-dark); margin-bottom: 12px;">
          P(State | Z_1, Z_2, Z_3) = [ &prod; P(Z_k | State) &bull; P(State) ] / P(Z_1, Z_2, Z_3)
        </div>
        <p style="font-size: 0.82rem; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.5;">
          Eliminates false alarms caused by localized rainfall spikes, agricultural watering, or animal disturbances.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- High-Resolution ML Pipeline & Performance Diagrams -->
    <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 20px; margin-bottom: 32px;">
      <div class="screen-fit-container" style="margin-bottom: 0;">
        <div class="screen-fit-header">
          <div>
            <span>EDGE AI &bull; MULTI-STAGE ML INFERENCE PIPELINE</span>
          </div>
          <button type="button" class="zoom-hint-badge" title="Click to open screen-fit inspection mode">
            <svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" style="margin-right: 4px;"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"/><path d="m21 21-4.35-4.35"/></svg>
            INSPECT HD DIAGRAM
          </button>
        </div>
        <img 
          src="/circuit-diagrams/ML - Pipeline.png" 
          alt="Machine Learning Pipeline Architecture Diagram" 
          data-caption="Multi-Stage Sensor Fusion ML Pipeline: 20 Telemetry Streams &rarr; 80-D Rolling Feature Tensor &rarr; XGBoost 2.0 / Mohr-Coulomb Dual Voting &rarr; Actuation Trigger"
          class="screen-fit-img" 
        />
        <div style="background: #F8FAFC; padding: 12px 16px; border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 8px;">
          <span style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.70rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--accent-primary); background: #EFF6FF; border: 1px solid #BFDBFE; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px; flex-shrink: 0;">CAPTION</span>
          <span style="font-size: 0.78rem; color: var(--text-primary); line-height: 1.4;">Figure 01: Multi-Stage Sensor Fusion ML Pipeline — 20 In-Situ streams &rarr; 80-D rolling tensor &rarr; dual voting consensus &rarr; relay trigger.</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="screen-fit-container" style="margin-bottom: 0;">
        <div class="screen-fit-header">
          <div>
            <span>VALIDATION &bull; MODEL PERFORMANCE &amp; CONFUSION MATRIX</span>
          </div>
          <button type="button" class="zoom-hint-badge" title="Click to open screen-fit inspection mode">
            <svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" style="margin-right: 4px;"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"/><path d="m21 21-4.35-4.35"/></svg>
            INSPECT HD DIAGRAM
          </button>
        </div>
        <img 
          src="/circuit-diagrams/ML - Performance Metrics.png" 
          alt="Machine Learning Performance Metrics and Confusion Matrix" 
          data-caption="ML Model Validation: 94.2% F1-Score, 0.89% False Negative Rate, 8.4ms Inference Profile on Raspberry Pi 5"
          class="screen-fit-img" 
        />
        <div style="background: #F8FAFC; padding: 12px 16px; border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 8px;">
          <span style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.70rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--accent-primary); background: #EFF6FF; border: 1px solid #BFDBFE; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px; flex-shrink: 0;">CAPTION</span>
          <span style="font-size: 0.78rem; color: var(--text-primary); line-height: 1.4;">Figure 02: Model Performance Metrics — 94.2% F1-Score, 0.89% False Negative rate, 8.4ms deterministic inference budget.</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Edge Compute Station Hardware Specs -->
    <h2 class="section-title">Raspberry Pi 5 Master Gateway Execution Benchmarks</h2>

    <div class="table-container" style="margin-bottom: 36px;">
      <table class="data-table">
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th>Pipeline Stage</th>
            <th>Execution Engine</th>
            <th>Measured Latency</th>
            <th>RAM Allocation</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr>
            <td><strong>RF Packet CRC &amp; AES-128 GCM Verification</strong></td>
            <td>C++ CryptoCore</td>
            <td>0.42 ms</td>
            <td>1.2 MB</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><strong>Bayesian Extended Kalman Filter (EKF)</strong></td>
            <td>Eigen C++ Optimized Matrix Ops</td>
            <td>1.18 ms</td>
            <td>4.8 MB</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><strong>LibTorch PINN Forward Inference</strong></td>
            <td>ARM NEON 4-Thread SIMD Core</td>
            <td>14.20 ms</td>
            <td>38.4 MB</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><strong>Dynamic Mohr-Coulomb Factor of Safety (FS)</strong></td>
            <td>Analytical C++ SIMD Vector</td>
            <td>0.85 ms</td>
            <td>0.5 MB</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><strong>FSM Decision &amp; Hardware Relay Trigger</strong></td>
            <td>Zero-Copy Linux /dev/gpiod</td>
            <td>0.14 ms</td>
            <td>0.2 MB</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><strong>Total End-to-End Edge Pipeline</strong></td>
            <td><strong>Autonomous Gateway OS</strong></td>
            <td><strong>16.79 ms</strong></td>
            <td><strong>&lt; 50 MB Total</strong></td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>

    <!-- Call to Action -->
    <div style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f8fafc 0%, #edf2f7 100%); border: 1.5px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius: var(--radius-lg); padding: 28px; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 40px;">
      <h3 style="font-size: 1.3rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--text-primary); margin-bottom: 8px;">Explore Hazard Detection &amp; Risk Assessment Models</h3>
      <p style="font-size: 0.92rem; color: var(--text-secondary); max-width: 650px; margin: 0 auto 20px;">
        Review mathematical formulations for slope stability, flash flood hydrographs, and wildfire spread.
      </p>
      <a href="/hazard-risk" class="btn btn-primary">Proceed to Hazard &amp; Risk Formulation &rarr;</a>
    </div>

  </div>
</Layout>
